      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14020/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water and salt to a boil in a saucepan. Whisk in grits; continue to whisk for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/na3WWMFZHPfUt3rFS8MMriqtbgw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14020-breakfast-grits-ddmfs-step-2-1d3c14bb1d7741a99702d1a64233dc5b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14020/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the mixture comes to a boil again, turn the heat to low. Stir frequently, cook for 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LOEw_i5J-5n5qOz_KWP10EUnY8I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14020-breakfast-grits-ddmfs-step-3-37c2b0103e6d435f830dbf78592893cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14020/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove grits from the heat and add cheese, butter, and pepper; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
